## Modification Notice (GPLv3 §5(a))
This `x11/` module is adapted from `termux/termux-x11` for direct integration
inside this repository, with modifications introduced between **2026-10-20**
and **2026-11-15**, including:

- In-app Gradle subproject integration (`x11/build.gradle`) and IPC/activity
  wiring inside the main app package.
- Removal of the periodic 200 ms `serverWatchdog` polling thread in favor of
  event-driven `onActivityResumed` / `onActivityPaused` lifecycle hooks.
- Dynamic foreground notification state synchronization (`X_` / `>_`).
- Wake-lock / keep-screen-awake handling on X11 `ScreenSaverSuspend` / reset.
- `hardwareAcceleration` preference wiring and `termux-x11-env` runtime environment setup.

